OL,3,GNEWSAControversial red route approved
OL,4,Aby city council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new red route along a shopping street
OL,7,Fin Brighton & Hove has been approved by
OL,8,Fcouncillors.
OL,10,FThe red route will prohibit drivers
OL,11,Ffrom stopping on Western Road, between
OL,12,FMontpelier Road and Holland Road, from
OL,13,FNovember after a vote by Brighton &
OL,14,FHove City Council's cabinet.
OL,16,FSome traders on the road had opposed
OL,17,Fthe change and a petition against the
OL,18,Fred route had been presented to the
OL,19,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
