OL,3,GNEWSAControversial red route approved
OL,4,Aby city council
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for transport and city
OL,7,Finfrastructure Trevor Muten said the
OL,8,Frestrictions would "help tackle
OL,9,Flong-standing problems with obstructive
OL,10,Fparking, congestion and delays".
